WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Top compression ring
What it does: Limits gas leakage into the crankcase and transfers some piston heat to the cylinder.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Top compression ring
How it works: Pressure helps maintain sealing contact.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Top compression ring
How it moves: Moves up and down with the piston; the end gap allows thermal expansion.
